# Disable Jekyll on GitHub Pages. This repo uses no Jekyll features — no front
# matter, no _layouts, no _includes — and Pages should copy files verbatim.
#
# Specifically: /index.md is a Markdown twin of the homepage, served as-is for
# agents that request Markdown (see <link rel="alternate"> in index.html).
# Without this file, Jekyll could render it to HTML and collide with index.html.
